  "prefLabel": "Fis 1002.02 Agent",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1002.02 “Agent” means a person who has been duly authorized in writing by an applicant, owner, or permit holder, as applicable, to interact with the department regarding a proposed action, approval, permit, or other authorization under review.\n\nSource. #13313, eff 2-3-22",
